### Testes de Schedule API
### Requer autenticação - fazer login primeiro

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = 

### 1. Login para obter token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@medflow.local",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Listar profissionais (para obter staffId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

### 3. Criar configuração de agenda
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/config
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "staffId": "STAFF_ID_AQUI",
  "defaultDuration": 30,
  "weeklySchedule": {
    "monday": {
      "enabled": true,
      "periods": [
        { "start": "08:00", "end": "12:00" },
        { "start": "14:00", "end": "18:00" }
      ]
    },
    "tuesday": {
      "enabled": true,
      "periods": [
        { "start": "08:00", "end": "12:00" }
      ]
    },
    "wednesday": {
      "enabled": true,
      "periods": [
        { "start": "08:00", "end": "12:00" },
        { "start": "14:00", "end": "18:00" }
      ]
    },
    "thursday": {
      "enabled": true,
      "periods": [
        { "start": "08:00", "end": "12:00" }
      ]
    },
    "friday": {
      "enabled": true,
      "periods": [
        { "start": "08:00", "end": "12:00" },
        { "start": "14:00", "end": "18:00" }
      ]
    },
    "saturday": {
      "enabled": false
    },
    "sunday": {
      "enabled": false
    }
  },
  "isActive": true
}

### 4. Buscar configuração por profissional
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/config/staff/STAFF_ID_AQUI
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

### 5. Atualizar configuração
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/schedule/config/staff/STAFF_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "defaultDuration": 45,
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Criar bloqueio de agenda (dia inteiro)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/blocks
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "staffId": "STAFF_ID_AQUI",
  "blockType": "date",
  "startDate": "2025-01-15",
  "reason": "Feriado",
  "isRecurring": false
}

### 7. Criar bloqueio de agenda (período)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/blocks
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "staffId": "STAFF_ID_AQUI",
  "blockType": "period",
  "startDate": "2025-01-20",
  "endDate": "2025-01-20",
  "startTime": "14:00",
  "endTime": "16:00",
  "reason": "Reunião",
  "isRecurring": false
}

### 8. Listar bloqueios por profissional
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/blocks/staff/STAFF_ID_AQUI?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-01-31
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

### 9. Atualizar bloqueio
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/schedule/blocks/BLOCK_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "reason": "Reunião atualizada"
}

### 10. Deletar bloqueio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/schedule/blocks/BLOCK_ID_AQUI
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

